<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 20.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 20.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 20     June 19   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  272.940     273.660     247.020   10.49 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.250     309.380     306.830    0.79 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.060     158.090     158.970   -0.57 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.824	46.854	47.182   -0.76 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  449.940     449.280     419.180    7.34 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.505     140.470     141.685   -0.83 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.151	16.140	16.185   -0.21 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  239.000     241.430     212.430   12.51 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.874	 1.874	 1.888   -0.74 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.565	 1.570	 1.581   -1.01 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.695     189.320     183.135    3.58 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
